t 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Note&#160;11&#160;&#8211; Mezzanine Equity and Stockholders&#8217; Equity</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 36pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Preferred Stock</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Board of Directors is authorized to establish and designate different series of preferred stock and to fix and determine their voting powers and other rights and terms. The Company has <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_wfuAh-FoWkC2pIwPnWyafQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_i9TKxczFt0SgRScz6Y1thw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:TemporaryEquitySharesAuthorized" scale="0" id="Narr_hSojlegacEarkpAwrHdFYg"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_wfuAh-FoWkC2pIwPnWyafQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_Ex75R_pd_UWhTxQ42s4UaQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:TemporaryEquitySharesAuthorized" scale="0" id="Narr_MdwSuqioU0yvzABHRixBiQ">5,000,000</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> authorized shares of preferred stock with a par value of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_o2WRIXv010e-73VQZYSZWg" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_i9TKxczFt0SgRScz6Y1thw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:TemporaryEquityParOrStatedValuePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_8i4UtL6L4EKPvyYRcDnsrQ"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_o2WRIXv010e-73VQZYSZWg" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_Ex75R_pd_UWhTxQ42s4UaQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:TemporaryEquityParOrStatedValuePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_9Pm6P27rIEac8N0l4VsMRg">0.001</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> as of June 30, 2026 and December 31, 2025. Of this total, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_wfuAh-FoWkC2pIwPnWyafQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesAPreferredStockMember_j1naPgf1P0uT4bZsmfjDDA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:TemporaryEquitySharesAuthorized" scale="0" id="Narr_zc6v-BMAtEu4dE6ylBS37g"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_wfuAh-FoWkC2pIwPnWyafQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesAPreferredStockMember_xuPBJnIzbkGfxjOcWZ9YHQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:TemporaryEquitySharesAuthorized" scale="0" id="Narr_D3q2JYbBXkWKcYeP7WlbGA">49,626</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> shares are designated as Series&#160;A Preferred Stock and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_wfuAh-FoWkC2pIwPnWyafQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesBPreferredStockMember_VCSuC3jfjUqzFrEN9Js5bg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:TemporaryEquitySharesAuthorized" scale="0" id="Narr_dr97N_nDk0mw09mxSEMGwA"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_wfuAh-FoWkC2pIwPnWyafQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesBPreferredStockMember_jOcQNNW_rE2dEmMRFyAimQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:TemporaryEquitySharesAuthorized" scale="0" id="Narr_8RW6Vv3D9Ea3CmitbVo-8Q">800,000</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> shares are designated as Series B Convertible Preferred Stock (&#8220;Series B Preferred Stock&#8221;). There were <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_wfuAh-FoWkC2pIwPnWyafQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesAPreferredStockMember_j1naPgf1P0uT4bZsmfjDDA" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:TemporaryEquitySharesOutstanding" scale="0" id="Narr_qmaWJwcaH021tFS-UHzI7g"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_wfuAh-FoWkC2pIwPnWyafQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesAPreferredStockMember_xuPBJnIzbkGfxjOcWZ9YHQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:TemporaryEquitySharesOutstanding" scale="0" id="Narr_K03wRCJsh0iN9Guh9RPJAQ"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_wfuAh-FoWkC2pIwPnWyafQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesAPreferredStockMember_j1naPgf1P0uT4bZsmfjDDA" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:TemporaryEquitySharesIssued" scale="0" id="Narr__pXKV6H8Lkiw4wPuAUWJtg"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_wfuAh-FoWkC2pIwPnWyafQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesAPreferredStockMember_xuPBJnIzbkGfxjOcWZ9YHQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:TemporaryEquitySharesIssued" scale="0" id="Narr_QYltwFczZk2VxAgoJp32gw">nil</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> shares of Series&#160;A Preferred Stock issued and outstanding on June 30, 2026 and December 31, 2025, and there were <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_wfuAh-FoWkC2pIwPnWyafQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesBPreferredStockMember_VCSuC3jfjUqzFrEN9Js5bg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:TemporaryEquitySharesOutstanding" scale="0" id="Narr_s9sL90SSIk2BEaj_L8_s7Q"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_wfuAh-FoWkC2pIwPnWyafQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesBPreferredStockMember_jOcQNNW_rE2dEmMRFyAimQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:TemporaryEquitySharesOutstanding" scale="0" id="Narr_8urT5n2aN0-cG0E-jzhfUg"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_wfuAh-FoWkC2pIwPnWyafQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesBPreferredStockMember_VCSuC3jfjUqzFrEN9Js5bg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:TemporaryEquitySharesIssued" scale="0" id="Narr_l2-5mfjlwEGYNGIiAVu8xQ"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_wfuAh-FoWkC2pIwPnWyafQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2025_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesBPreferredStockMember_jOcQNNW_rE2dEmMRFyAimQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:TemporaryEquitySharesIssued" scale="0" id="Narr_kPlDwjR7YUqomknHhQuMIA">419,959</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> shares of Series B Preferred Stock issued and outstanding as of June 30, 2026 and December 31, 2025.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;">Each share of Series B Preferred Stock is convertible, at the option of the holder, into <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_rDitsLzvCE6RaAkcVtAKQg" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_SeriesBPreferredStockMember_VCSuC3jfjUqzFrEN9Js5bg" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:PreferredStockConvertibleConversionRatio" scale="0" id="Narr_ClvoHCH6w02tPCQxfBG2OQ">ten</ix:nonFraction> shares of common stock, subject to adjustment for stock splits, stock dividends, and similar transactions. The Company may, at its option at </p></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">15</p></div></div>
