avbSHVUHA;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">PSUs</span></span> to its CEO and CFO. The fair market value on the date of award of the RSUs and <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_trFEvPSTB0GXmeIGVStHjw;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">PSUs </span></span>was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_o2WRIXv010e-73VQZYSZWg" contextRef="As_Of_4_29_2026_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_vuzi_ChiefExecutiveOfficerAndChiefFinancialOfficerMember_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_dqvAUCX0n0qV6Nd2mF1mgA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsNonvestedWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" scale="0" id="Narr_5ud_-nMVXkiMaIrJKf_T3g">2.41</ix:nonFraction> per unit. The RSUs will vest over time at a rate of <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_hNkaQKAtbky2KOm_16UOAQ;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">one-third </span></span>annually on each December 15, 2026, 2027, and 2028. The PSUs will vest upon the achievement of certain revenue and EBITDA targets before December 31, 2028. As of June 30, 2026, these targets are considered probable and the associated expense is being amortized. If both the revenue and EBITDA targets are exceeded by <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_rDitsLzvCE6RaAkcVtAKQg" contextRef="Duration_6_30_2026_To_6_30_2026_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_vuzi_ChiefExecutiveOfficerAndChiefFinancialOfficerMember_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_PerformanceSharesMember__UNB1_iZu0aq3AoDMAXo3g" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vuzi:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAdditionalAwardsVestingConditionThresholdPercentageOfRevenueOfEbitda" scale="-2" id="Narr_GEnRWV-Sz0u6DDRUMH47BA">150</ix:nonFraction>%, an additional <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_wfuAh-FoWkC2pIwPnWyafQ" contextRef="Duration_6_30_2026_To_6_30_2026_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_vuzi_ChiefExecutiveOfficerAndChiefFinancialOfficerMember_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_PerformanceSharesMember__UNB1_iZu0aq3AoDMAXo3g" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vuzi:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfAdditionalSharesUponReachingTargetLevels" scale="0" id="Narr_lYKJAyKYIkazCbrKRtk6-g">167,609</ix:nonFraction> PSUs could be issued and vest immediately. As of June 30, 2026, these bonus targets are not considered probable and their fair market value is not being amortized in stock-based compensation expense. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On March 19, 2025, the Company granted <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_wfuAh-FoWkC2pIwPnWyafQ" contextRef="Duration_3_19_2025_To_3_19_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_PerformanceSharesMember_us-gaap_GranteeStatusAxis_vuzi_ShareBasedPaymentArrangementEmployeesExcludingCertainMembersOfSeniorManagementMember_ZWL8N3ZzoEuvMwYOjop62w" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_f1usUQiIfkeOz-QWQzzfPA">207,404</ix:nonFraction> PSUs to certain employees with a total grant-date fair value of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_9-Bty0nPM0W2JIJ7ScmAOQ" contextRef="Duration_3_19_2025_To_3_19_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_PerformanceSharesMember_us-gaap_GranteeStatusAxis_vuzi_ShareBasedPaymentArrangementEmployeesExcludingCertainMembersOfSeniorManagementMember_ZWL8N3ZzoEuvMwYOjop62w" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vuzi:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriodTotalGrantDateFairValue" scale="0" id="Narr_QgVPlPSCwkWrxGDJ6dTSmQ">477,029</ix:nonFraction> ($<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_o2WRIXv010e-73VQZYSZWg" contextRef="As_Of_3_19_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_PerformanceSharesMember_us-gaap_GranteeStatusAxis_vuzi_ShareBasedPaymentArrangementEmployeesExcludingCertainMembersOfSeniorManagementMember_zDxnwAIWC0KxM5CnQxC6ZA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsNonvestedWeightedAverageGrantDateFairValue" scale="0" id="Narr_t_XMIMdovEah4tF5NTb7Pw">2.30</ix:nonFraction> per unit), which was being expensed over a <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_3_19_2025_To_3_19_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_PerformanceSharesMember_us-gaap_GranteeStatusAxis_vuzi_ShareBasedPaymentArrangementEmployeesExcludingCertainMembersOfSeniorManagementMember_ZWL8N3ZzoEuvMwYOjop62w" format="ixt-sec:duryear" name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognizedPeriodForRecognition1" id="Narr_hZBeAQPAHEm4ZL5M4sgqOg">20.5</ix:nonNumeric>-month service period. The awards vest upon achievement of specified revenue and EBITDA targets. During the three months ended June 30, 2026, management determined that achievement of these targets was no longer probable of achievement within the service period of the awards and, accordingly, reversed the cumulative compensation expense of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_9-Bty0nPM0W2JIJ7ScmAOQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_PerformanceSharesMember_us-gaap_GranteeStatusAxis_vuzi_ShareBasedPaymentArrangementEmployeesExcludingCertainMembersOfSeniorManagementMember_tgJK64thH0GdcZJGf3lSlg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vuzi:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardCompensationCostReversal" scale="0" id="Narr_mWfmjW-0QUWsimkjzIl6Dg">313,885</ix:nonFraction> previously recognized for the awards.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;">For the three months ended June 30, 2026 and 2025, the Company recorded total stock-based compensation expense, including stock awards but excluding stock option awards under the Company&#8217;s former LTIP, of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_9-Bty0nPM0W2JIJ7ScmAOQ" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_WjTnZRmUdUmf8jdSkGtz-A" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vuzi:ShareBasedCompensationExcludeLongTermIncentivePlan" scale="0" id="Narr_jBVzaQHZfES1ca5qUgFVdw">654,613</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_9-Bty0nPM0W2JIJ7ScmAOQ" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_fHdgXR7G0kOtNObvBPTatA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vuzi:ShareBasedCompensationExcludeLongTermIncentivePlan" scale="0" id="Narr_IJaCNIy_UEyAs8N2wG8ZsQ">842,596</ix:nonFraction>, respectively. For the six months ended June 30, 2026 and 2025, the Company recorded total stock-based compensation expense, including stock awards but excluding stock option awards under the Company&#8217;s former LTIP, of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_9-Bty0nPM0W2JIJ7ScmAOQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_JR1DRBt7TUOVmfGjIR0_Xg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vuzi:ShareBasedCompensationExcludeLongTermIncentivePlan" scale="0" id="Narr_HQoUJNgD2UyDBuv43y9aZQ">1,292,915</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_9-Bty0nPM0W2JIJ7ScmAOQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_qdedTSpDsUO-ZtWG2PNNPw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="vuzi:ShareBasedCompensationExcludeLongTermIncentivePlan" scale="0" id="Narr_yxzs8vGoOUuEufLiWlL0RQ">2,545,398</ix:nonFraction>, respectively.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;">As of June 30, 2026, the Company had $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_9-Bty0nPM0W2JIJ7ScmAOQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_i9TKxczFt0SgRScz6Y1thw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognized" scale="0" id="Narr_ujKbykj9zEOyxutftj_tGA">5,284,620</ix:nonFraction> of unrecognized stock-based compensation expense related to all stock options, RSAs, RSUs, and PSUs considered probable, which will be recognized over a weighted average period of <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_JR1DRBt7TUOVmfGjIR0_Xg" format="ixt-sec:duryear" name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognizedPeriodForRecognition1" id="Narr_nHmFbtP5ZkOO8VVtUtV1SQ">2.1</ix:nonNumeric> years. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;">For the six months ended June 30, 2025, the Company recorded non-cash stock-based compensation expense of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_9-Bty0nPM0W2JIJ7ScmAOQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_us-gaap_DeferredCompensationArrangementWithIndividualShareBasedPaymentsByTypeOfDeferredCompensationAxis_us-gaap_EmployeeStockOptionMember_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_vuzi_LongTermIncentivePlanMember_3lauPqm8_EybRIz8LrQs0A" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensation" scale="0" id="Narr_KSNfMMThRkCZDKFP-WARaA">1,180,356</ix:nonFraction> for the former LTIP options that vested or were probable to vest, prior to their cancellation effective June 16, 2025. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;">These expenses are presented in the same financial statement line items in the Statements of Operations as the cash-based compensation expenses for the same employees. </p></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><a id="Tc_opU6I_-4BUi12DC1A_xqig_1_0"></a><a id="Tc_3CYzrB10PE60h7kw7JA5Jg_1_2"></a><a id="Tc_Z4zyBpBfJkCGYMOUY_OzLw_2_0"></a><a id="Tc_wcSjW3_UmE2gBIEaXxxClA_3_0"></a><a id="Tc_a9kdufrw7kuGsWeLuoOdAw_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_U9m-dAs9KU6XDWHz1NnXhQ_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_XU2aV5L_qk2wekVddzU_jw_5_2"></a><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_JR1DRBt7TUOVmfGjIR0_Xg" name="us-gaap:LesseeOperatingLeasesTextBlock" id="Tb_I4RIVundJkqZwT7VbsQ1Zg" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Note&#160;13&#160;&#8211; Right-of-Use Assets and Liabilities</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.19;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;">Future lease payments under operating leases as of June 30, 2026, were as follows:</p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_JR1DRBt7TUOVmfGjIR0_Xg" name="us-gaap:LesseeOperatingLeaseLiabilityMaturityTableTextBlock" id="Tb_MLBHW81ITk2eienmMmkNiQ" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height